===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Quaxwell|53}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*'''Splashing Turn''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Unseen Forces|Suicune ☆|115|Suicune}}{{Star}} from the {{TCG|EX Unseen Forces}} expansion.
